{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21490","headline":"酬乐天寄蕲州簟 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天寄蕲州簟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蕲簟未经春，君先拭翠筠。\n知爲热时物，预与瘴中人。\n碾玉连心润，编牙小片珍。\n霜凝青汗简，冰透碧游鳞。\n水魄轻涵黛，琉璃薄带尘。\n梦成伤冷滑，惊卧老龙身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}